  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "An electric bulb rated as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is used in a circuit having <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> supply. The resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;that must be put in series with the bulb so that the bulb delivers the same power is ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Power, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>P</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mn>200</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/61bdfd21-129e-4145-bb3a-6764003b52c2-image.png\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p>To produce same power, same voltage (i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>) should be across the bulb.&nbsp;</p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
